  "behaviour": [
    "Staff are separate from customer accounts; staff routes live under /v1/admin (conventions.md).",
    "Roles: owner, ops, moderator, reviewer, support, finance, maker. A staff member may hold several.",
    "The first owner is created from STAFF_BOOTSTRAP_OWNER_EMAIL on first boot; after that only an owner invites or changes roles.",
    "There must always be at least one active owner; the last owner cannot be suspended or demoted.",
    "Every staff write is written to audit-log."
